"RebelEngine/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md>`__ guide to learn how to fork, "
"modify, and submit a Pull Request (PR) with your changes."
msgstr ""
"Als Erstes können Sie sich die `Bugreports <https://github.com/godotengine/"
