#: development/editor/creating_icons.rst:37
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the user has configured their editor to use a light theme, Rebel Editor "
"will convert the icon's colors based on a set of predefined color mappings. "
"This is to ensure the icon always displays with a sufficient contrast rate. "
"Try to restrict your icon's color palette to colors found in the list above. "
