#: getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_first_script.rst:137
msgid "Hello, world!"
msgstr "Hallo, Welt!"

#: getting_started/step_by_step/scripting_first_script.rst:139
msgid ""
"Our script currently doesn't do anything. Let's make it print the text "
"\"Hello, world!\" to the Output bottom panel to get started."
msgstr ""
"Unser Skript tut derzeit nichts. Lassen wir es den Text \"Hallo, Welt!\" in "
