#: tutorials/3d/gi_probes.rst:87
msgid ""
"``GIProbe``\\ s can be easily mixed with Reflection Probes and Screen Space "
"Reflections, as a full 3-stage fallback-chain. This allows to have precise "
"reflections where needed:"
