#: tutorials/inputs/controllers_gamepads_joysticks.rst:126
msgid "Differences between keyboard/mouse and controller input"
msgstr "Unterschiede zwischen Tastatur/Maus und Controller-Eingabe"

#: tutorials/inputs/controllers_gamepads_joysticks.rst:128
msgid ""
"If you're used to handling keyboard and mouse input, you may be surprised by "
"how controllers handle specific situations."
