#: tutorials/shaders/converting_glsl_to_rebel_shaders.rst:8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For detailed information on Rebel Shading Language, please refer to the :doc:"
"`/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language` reference."
