"etc.). These parameters correspond to different complex effects (Ambient "
"Occlusion, SubSurface Scattering, Rim Lighting, etc.). When not written to, "
"the code is thrown out before it is compiled and so the shader does not "
"incur the cost of the extra feature. This makes it easy for users to have "
"complex PBR-correct shading, without writing complex shaders. Of course, "
"Rebel Engine also allows you to ignore all these parameters and write a "
"fully customized shader."
